# 统一换行符：仓库内以 LF 存储，检出时按平台处理
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 脚本保持 CRLF，避免在 cmd 下执行异常
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制与不应被文本处理改写的文件
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary

# 让 GitHub 语言统计与 diff 更准确
*.json text
*.yml text
*.yaml text
*.toml text
*.md text
